{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PG8F27TTPXrkJzwMQKtBsz","type":"tool_result","content":"6:import { textFitsMeasured, withLayoutIntent } from \"../../../_shared/layout\";\n21: * under them as four equal smaller tiles, and their numbers are capped at\n172:    description: \"Dev-only: check the layout contract (every text fits its box, the header on top, two equal headline tiles, four equal stat tiles, the milestone band across the bottom) and draw it over the card.\",\n215:export type Milestone = { kind: \"R\" | \"V\"; club: number; count: number; caption: string };\n346: * Equal rects for a group of equal slots, each ON the parent lattice with a\n355: * unequal although the engine draws them equal.\n605:     * One arrangement: `rowsN` rows of `slots` equal slots, the badges snapped like the\n606:     * tiles (equal, on the lattice, 5-smooth) and the type sized for the snapped badge.\n819:    constraints.push(textFitsMeasured(c.label, c.text, c.px, c.width));\n842:  // two equal headline tiles and four equal stat tiles; the milestone band\n843:  // across the lower card every week, its badges equal and inside it; the\n846:  constraints.push({ label: nameLabel, within: { yFrac: [0, 0.25] } });\n847:  constraints.push({ label: \"header-rule\", minWidthFrac: 0.85 });\n848:  constraints.push({ label: \"hero-tile\", within: { yFrac: [0.1, 0.8] } });\n849:  constraints.push({ label: \"stat-tile\", minWidthFrac: 0.15 });\n851:  constraints.push({ label: \"milestone-band\", within: { yFrac: [0.55, 1] }, minWidthFrac: 0.85 });\n852:  if (L.badges.length > 0) constraints.push({ label: \"badge\", within: { yFrac: [L.band.y / H, (L.band.y + L.band.h) / H] } });\n854:  if (L.cells.some((c) => c.label === \"footer\")) constraints.push({ label: \"footer\", within: { yFrac: [0.9, 1] } });\n857:    { label: \"hero-tile\", equal: \"size\", tolerancePx: 2 },\n858:    { label: \"stat-tile\", equal: \"size\", tolerancePx: 2 },\n860:  if (L.badges.length >= 2) relations.push({ label: \"badge\", equal: \"size\", tolerancePx: 2 });\n    50, 100, 250, 500, 1000)\"; \"milestones: R25 appears twice\"; \"milestones:\n    11 entries, at most 10 fit one card\".\n- **`date`**: `YYYY-MM-DD` and a real calendar date. The weekday is computed\n  from the date (Zeller or day count), never from a clock. Any weekday is\n  accepted, because junior events and specials run on other days.\n- **Character set**: `eventName` and `footer` accept printable ASCII plus\n  Latin-1 and Latin Extended-A (U+00C0-U+017F, the `DRAWN` set the swim,\n  cubing and radio cards use). Anything else is refused, naming the\n  character.\n- **Fit ladder**:\n  - Event name: shrink to 70% of its design size, then refuse.\n  - Footer: shrink alone to the floor, then refuse.\n  - Never ellipsis.\n  - The floor is `max(6, round(S * 0.022))`. Defaults must clear it on all\n    seven contract canvases.\n- **`accent`**: `isColor` plus `colorPicker`, validated `#rrggbb`, with `\"\"`\n  falling back to the default. Hero numbers in the accent must keep 4.5:1\n  contrast against the page. If the user's accent fails that, the numbers go\n  to ink and only fills use the accent.\n- **Page**: light paper (`#f6f4ee`) and ink (`#1b1f1c`). It prints, and it\n  reads on Facebook's light and dark themes because the card is its own\n  rectangle.\n\nTest vectors:\n\n| input | expected |\n|---|---|\n| `4xR25, 3xR50, 1xR100, 2xV25` | badges 25 `4 runners`, 50 `3 runners`, 100 `1 runner`, 25 `2 volunteers` (volunteer fill) |\n| `1xr100,4xR25` | 25 `4 runners`, then 100 `1 runner` |\n| `\"\"` | no badges; line `No milestone clubs this week` |\n| `4xR30` | refused, names `R30` |","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FX5tNdu2GdQj8RAWQjKBx5","session_id":"c85b8a49-1fe0-40b1-a281-e4278d224d69","uuid":"5cb687e9-2a22-4548-ba95-e870364b7f9d","timestamp":"2026-10-06T21:10:31.372Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Adversarial code audit variant a"}
